# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Interval Timer — .gitignore
#  .NET / WinUI 3 / classic UWP / Visual Studio, plus Python tooling.
#
#  The generated assets ARE committed on purpose so the projects build
#  without running Python:
#    IntervalTimer*/Assets/**/*.wav
#    IntervalTimer*/Assets/*.png
#    IntervalTimerOverlay/Assets/app.ico
#  They are NOT ignored below.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
publish/
*.log

## Visual Studio / MSBuild
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.tlog
*.binlog

## MSIX / AppX packaging output
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
GeneratedArtifacts/
_pkginfo.txt
Package.StoreAssociation.xml
ModelManifest.xml
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.msixupload

## Signing material (test certs are regenerated on build)
*.pfx
*.snk
*_TemporaryKey.pfx

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

## Publish profile user overrides (the .pubxml files themselves are tracked)
*.pubxml.user

## Tests / coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*/

## Rider / ReSharper
.idea/
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

## Python tooling (tools/)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

## OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
